[I] Tools for deduping file systems

[T] Duperemove is a simple tool for finding duplicated extents in files and
[T] submitting them for deduplication using the Linux kernel FIDEDUPERANGE
[T] ioctl, e.g. on btrfs or XFS. Hashes can be stored in a hashfile so that
[T] repeated runs only rescan changed files.

[U] https://github.com/markfasheh/duperemove

[A] Duperemove Authors
